oxiport runs SPARQL queries and updates against an Oxigraph RDF store,
for use as an Erlang or Elixir port.

Its interactive mode reads query and update commands, one per line,
and has the GeoSPARQL functions. With --jsonl it speaks a versioned
request protocol: correlated SELECT and ASK queries with JSON results,
and updates acknowledged only after the store is flushed to disk.
jsonl_port is the Elixir client for that protocol.

Oxigraph 0.5 with its RocksDB storage is built in from source.
